# {{context|regional|chiefly|northern Germany|chiefly|colloquial|slang|lang=de}} {{alternative form of|derb|lang=de}}
#: ''Der Typ is’ echt '''derbe'''.''
#:: That guy’s really '''rough''' (≈ '''cool''').

====Usage notes====
* The form is used in northern German slang to describe a kind of “rough coolness” but is also an [[expletive]].

